  "text": "Dr. Ashenafie Tsegaye is an automotive professional, former General Motors corporate leader, and author who spent nearly five decades in the automotive sector. He is best known for his recent memoir chronicling his experiences as an immigrant navigating the upper echelons of corporate America. \"The Road to Detroit\" Memoir In March 2026, Dr. Tsegaye"
